        "title": "Noble Phantasm",
        "audioUrl": "https://res.cloudinary.com/mtns8net/video/upload/v1790188258/S377_Stage3_NP1_jovymy.ogg",
        "text": "Calamity comes from the sea... Behold. This is the answer to your prosperity. It is the twinkling of a meteor that slashes across the sky of desire! Babalon Domus Aurea!"
      }
