        "text": "A summons… a summons? Hehe… well done, summoning me… My name is Dante Alighieri… As you know, I am the author of the Divine Comedy… As a Pretender, I am also the main character of the Divine Comedy… Hehe… in summary… I look forward to your continued support…"
