        "title": "Noble Phantasm",
        "audioUrl": "https://res.cloudinary.com/mtns8net/video/upload/v1790188574/S437_Stage3_NP2_tpih0z.ogg",
        "text": "Ah, the seat of God has vanished—all that remains is this gate to Hell! Don’t look, don’t look! Worms bore through the brain; Hell begins its march! “Lasciate ogne speranza, voi ch'intrate!”"
      }
